``` Recorded extraction from Spanish rendered events; the table was confirmed in the practice. ```
``` Relative windows refer to the original live searches; use the original window for historical replay. ```
``` Original identifiers are omitted. Scope to the same endpoint in a multi-host index and sanitize results before publication. ```
index=windows_soc EventCode=4674 earliest=-30m latest=now
| rex "Nombre de cuenta:\s+(?<user>\S+)"
| rex "Id\. de proceso:\s+(?<process_id>0x[0-9A-Fa-f]+)"
| rex "Nombre de proceso:\s+(?<process_name>[^\r\n]+)"
| rex "Privilegios:\s+(?<privilege>[^\r\n]+)"
| table _time EventCode user process_id process_name privilege host
| sort -_time

